Template: c4raven-server/domain
Type: string
Default:
Description: Public domain name for this server (optional):
 If this server has a public domain name that already points at its IP,
 enter it here to get a real Let's Encrypt certificate via certbot and
 enable Federation Hub to be reachable by hostname. Leave blank to use a
 self-signed certificate and access the server by IP address instead --
 you can always run certbot by hand later.

Template: c4raven-server/turnstile-enable
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Enable Cloudflare Turnstile on the login page?
 Turnstile adds a human-verification checkbox to the login page. You'll
 need a site key and secret key from the Cloudflare dashboard's Turnstile
 section already in hand if you say yes here.

Template: c4raven-server/turnstile-site-key
Type: string
Default:
Description: Turnstile site key:

Template: c4raven-server/turnstile-secret-key
Type: password
Description: Turnstile secret key:
